ndinavian\",scottish:\"Scottish\",seafood:\"Seafood\",shabu_shabu:\"Shabu Shabu (Hotpot)\",shabu_shabu_short:\"Shabu shabu\",shanghai:\"Shanghai Chinese\",shellfish:\"Crab & Shellfish\",sichuan:\"Sichuan Chinese\",singaporean:\"Singaporean\",soba:\"Soba Noodles\",soba_short:\"Soba\",soba_udon:\"Soba & Udon\",south_american:\"Latin & South American\",spanish:\"Spanish\",sports_bar:\"Sports Bar\",steak:\"Steak\",sukiyaki:\"Sukiyaki\",suppon:\"Suppon (Snapping Turtle)\",sushi:\"Sushi\",sushi_sashimi:\"Sushi & sashimi\",sweets:\"Dessert & Sweets\",taiwanese:\"Taiwan Chinese\",takoyaki:\"Takoyaki (Fried Octopus)\",tantanmen:\"Tantanmen\",tapas:\"Tapas & Small Plates\",tea:\"Afternoon Tea\",tempura:\"Tempura\",teppanyaki:\"Teppanyaki\",texmex:\"Southwestern & Tex-Mex\",thai:\"Thai\",thai_curry:\"Thai Curry\",thai_hotpot:\"Thai Hotpot\",title:\"Cuisine\",tofu:\"Tofu\",tonkatsu:\"Tonkatsu (Fried Pork Cutlet)\",tsukemen:\"Tsukemen (Dipping Ramen)\",turkish:\"Turkish\",udon:\"Udon Noodles\",udon_short:\"Udon\",unagi:\"Unagi (Freshwater Eel)\",vegan:\"Vegan\",vegetables:\"Vegetables\",vegetarian:\"Vegetarian\",vietnamese:\"Vietnamese\",western:\"Western\",wine_bar:\"Wine Bar\",wine_cocktails:\"Wine & cocktails\",yakiniku:\"Yakiniku & Korean BBQ\",yakiniku_bbq:\"Yakiniku & BBQ\",yakiniku_short:\"Yakiniku\",yakisoba:\"Yakisoba (Fried Noodles)\",yakitori:\"Yakitori & Kushiyaki (Skewers)\",yakitori_short:\"Yakitori\",yoshoku:\"Yoshoku (Japanese-style Western)\"},qJe={description:\"Your customer score shows how reliably you keep your bookings, so restaurants can see you're a guest they can count on. The higher your score, the more perks you unlock.\",explainer:{factors:{reliability:{body:\"Attending your reservations is the quickest way to build your Customer Score.\",title:\"Reliability\"},reservation_history:{body:\"How often you book and dine at TableCheck venues over time.\",title:\"Reservation history\"},transactions:{body:\"Completed bookings and spend through the platform.\",title:\"Transactions\"},venues_visited:{body:\"The number of different venues you make reservations at through TableCheck.\",title:\"Venues visited\"}},factors_intro:\"Customer Score shows how you dine with TableCheck & is based on the following factors:\",factors_title:\"Score factors\",faq:{booking_block:{answer:\"Your score never blocks a reservation. Some venues may ask for a deposit or card guarantee before confirming.\",question:\"Can my score stop me booking?\"},data_used:{answer:\"Reservation history, venues visited, and completed transactions made through TableCheck. Nothing outside the platform is used.\",question:\"What data is used?\"},improve:{answer:\"Keep the bookings you make, arrive on time, and cancel early when plans change. Your score builds as completed reservations add up.\",question:\"How do I improve my score?\"},no_score:{answer:\"A score appears once you have completed a few bookings through TableCheck. Until then, restaurants simply see you as a new guest.\",question:\"Why don't I have a score?\"},no_show:{answer:\"No. A single no-show has a limited effect, and your score recovers as you keep the bookings that follow.\",question:\"Will one no-show ruin my score?\"},who_can_see:{answer:\"Only the restaurants you book with. They see your score when you make a reservation — never the details of where else you have dined.\",question:\"Who can see my score?\"}},faq_title:\"FAQ\",hero_image_alt:\"A diner checking their customer score in the TableCheck app\",hero_subtitle:\"Use TableCheck, get rewarded.\",hero_title:\"Customer Score\",how_title:\"How does it work?\",other_faqs_cta:\"Other FAQs\",perks:{membership:\"Access to membership\",offers:\"Offers & perks\",venue_access:\"Exclusive venue access\"},steps:{avoid_cancel:{body:\"Last minute cancellations & no-shows may affect your score the most, try to avoid these.\",title:\"Avoid late cancellations\"},benefits:{body:\"Getting a higher score will earn you offers, perks & access to exclusive venues.\",title:\"Enjoy the benefits\"},book:{body:\"Completing reservations through TableCheck helps to build your customer score.\",title:\"Book on TableCheck\"},habits:{body:\"The more completed bookings you have, the more your score will increase over time.\",title:\"Keep consistent habits\"}},what_is_intro:\"Your customer score reflects how reliably you keep the bookings you make, so restaurants can see at a glance that you're a guest they can count on. The higher your score climbs, the more perks you get, including:\",what_is_title:\"What is customer score?\"},guidance:{frequency:{complete_visits:\"Complete {{required_actions}} more visits in the next 90 days to help improve your score.\"},recency:{come_back:\"Book again within {{within_days}} days to help improve your score.\"},reliability:{complete_reservations:\"Complete {{required_actions}} more bookings without cancelling to help improve your score.\"}},insights:{booking_frequency:{description:\"Booking more often through TableCheck raises this the fastest. <actionLink>Find a table</actionLink>\",title_value:\"Recent booking: <bold>{{count}}</bold>\",title_value_plural:\"Recent bookings: <bold>{{count}}</bold>\"},improve_pill:\"Improve your score\",reliability:{description:\"Measures bookings you attend. Late cancellations and no-shows affect this most.\",title_value:\"Reliability rate: <bold>{{value}}</bold>\"},transactions:{description:\"Deposits and payments made with TableCheck Pay count toward this. <actionLink>How Pay works</actionLink>\",title_value:\"Spend: <bold>{{value}}</bold>\"},venues_visited:{description:\"Booking new venues through TableCheck raises this over time. <actionLink>Explore venues</actionLink>\",title_value:\"Venue visited: <bold>{{count}}</bold>\",title_value_plural:\"Venues visited: <bold>{{count}}</bold>\"}},insights_period:\"Last 12 months\",insights_title:\"Your score insights\",levels:{excellent:\"Excellent\",fair:\"Fair\",good:\"Good\",great:\"Great\",low:\"Low\"},offers:{book_with_offer:\"Book with offer\",claim_failed:\"Couldn't claim this offer. Please try again.\",code_copied:\"Code copied\",copy:\"Copy\",promo_code:\"Promo code\",select_venue:\"Select venue\"},offers_title:\"Offers & perks\",overall_score:\"Overall score\",percentile:\"Top {{percent}}%\",perks:{claim:\"Claim\",claimed:\"Claimed\",score_required:\"{{level}} score required\"},status:{inactive:{description:\"Your score is back once you complete another booking. It's calculated fresh each time, from your booking history.\"},insufficient_history:{description:\"Your score appears once you've completed 5 bookings. Cancellations and no-shows don't count.\"},score_suppressed:{description:\"Your score is back once you complete another booking. It's calculated fresh each time, from your booking history.\"},unavailable:{description:\"We can't show your score right now. Try again shortly.\"}},title:\"Customer score\",venue_diversity_levels:{multi_venue:\"Multi Venue\",not_established:\"Not Established\",single_venue:\"Single Venue\"},verify:{code_input_label:\"Verification code, digit {{index}}\",code_resent:\"Code sent\",code_sent:\"We have sent an SMS to <strong>{{phone}}</strong>. Enter the verification code below.\",cta:\"Send code\",heading:\"Available to users in Japan\",invalid_code:\"That code isn't right. Please try again.\",japan_only:\"Please enter a Japanese mobile number.\",phone_verified:\"Phone number verified\",resend:\"Resend code\",resend_countdown:\"Resend code in {{seconds}}\",title:\"Verify phone number\"},verify_description:\"Available to customers based in Japan, we're rolling out to other regions soon. Verify a Japanese mobile number to see your score & the perks it opens up.\"},ZJe={app_issue:\"We're sorry, something went wrong inside our application.\",page_not_found:\"We are sorry, the page you requested could not be found\"},QJe={badge:{explanation:\"This venue supports Express Booking, which is the quickest way to make a seating reservation.\"},bo