ンカー東京\"},{locale:le.chineseSimplified.code,translation:\"锚东京\"}],location_name_translations:[{locale:le.english.code,translation:\"Roppongi\"},{locale:le.japanese.code,translation:\"六本木\"},{locale:le.chineseSimplified.code,translation:\"六本木\"}],content_title_translations:[{locale:le.english.code,translation:\"Wine bar and bistro near Roppongi\"},{locale:le.japanese.code,translation:\"六本木近くのワインバー＆ビストロ\"},{locale:le.chineseSimplified.code,translation:\"六本木附近的葡萄酒吧与餐酒馆\"}],content_body_translations:[{locale:le.english.code,translation:\"Curated wines by the glass, small plates, and bistro mains in a lively room. Happy hour and late seating on weekends.\"},{locale:le.japanese.code,translation:\"グラスワインと小皿、ビストロのメインが楽しめる活気ある空間。ハッピーアワーと週末のレイトシートあり。\"},{locale:le.chineseSimplified.code,translation:\"精选杯卖葡萄酒、小食与餐酒馆主菜，氛围轻松。工作日欢乐时光与周末晚场可选。\"}],tagline_translations:[{locale:le.english.code,translation:\"Wine bar · Bistro\"},{locale:le.chineseSimplified.code,translation:\"葡萄酒吧 · 餐酒馆\"}],search_image:\"https://image.cdn.tablecheck.com/unsafe/full-fit-in/1280x720/smart/filters:format(webp)/https%3A%2F%2Fcdn3.tablecheck.com%2Fimages%2F5d12f1234f0fdadfde000f4d%2Fimages%2Flg%2FGHT_Anchor_Tokyo_%25E5%25A4%259C.jpg%3F1561522467\",images:[{id:\"anchor-tokyo-1\",original:\"https://3.image.cdn.tablecheck.com/unsafe/full-fit-in/720x420/smart/filters:format(webp)/https%3A%2F%2Fcdn2.tablecheck.com%2Fimages%2F5d12f12cacc8cedd78000b14%2Fimages%2Foriginal%2FAnchor_Tokyo_%25E3%2583%2590%25E3%2583%25BC%25E3%2582%25AB%25E3%2582%25A6%25E3%2583%25B3%25E3%2582%25BF%25E3%2583%25BC.jpg%3F1561522476\",thumbnail:\"https://3.image.cdn.tablecheck.com/unsafe/full-fit-in/720x420/smart/filters:format(webp)/https%3A%2F%2Fcdn2.tablecheck.com%2Fimages%2F5d12f12cacc8cedd78000b14%2Fimages%2Foriginal%2FAnchor_Tokyo_%25E3%2583%2590%25E3%2583%25BC%25E3%2582%25AB%25E3%2582%25A6%25E3%2583%25B3%25E3%2582%25BF%25E3%2583%25BC.jpg%3F1561522476\",caption:null},{id:\"anchor-tokyo-2\",original:\"https://3.image.cdn.tablecheck.c